From bfec124918b6e540ae969d73ca8937c3610144fa Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: bedasrv <266547973+bedasrv@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 00:18:32 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] plugins: add onRouteResult hook (per-attempt outcomes of a
 plugin-routed combo)

Records the HTTP status and classified kind of every dispatched combo attempt in the
combo decision trace (no error bodies), and sends them, with the pre-dispatch skips,
to plugins that declare hooks.onRouteResult once the plugin-routed combo has finished.
One-way notification (fire-and-forget, same isolation as onStreamComplete): a slow or
broken plugin cannot delay or fail the request. Lets a routing plugin learn which of its
picks are failing and demote them.

- decisionTrace: ComboTrace.outcomes + recordComboOutcome
- executeTargetAttempt: record outcome on success and on each failure path
- plugins: onRouteResult event, manifest flag, loader notification wiring, SDK/types
- chat: emitPluginRouteResult after handleComboChat; ephemeral combo carries traceInvocationId
- tests: plugins-onroute (outcomes, payload, fail-open), BUILTIN_EVENTS pin
